<title>SWEDEN: Swedish June CPI delayed by technical problems.</title>
<headline>Swedish June CPI delayed by technical problems.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The release of Sweden's June consumer price index has been delayed from 0715 GMT because of technical problems, a spokesman for Statistics Sweden said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the bureau hoped to be able to release the figures at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
